From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: root <root@docker01.fra.askei.net>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 20:42:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(spec): optional NGRAM speculation on Qwen4-Exp (not
 default)

Export the opt-in NGRAM changes separately from the default 3090 series.

- ngram_worker.py: force a linear draft chain (max_bfs_breadth == 1) because
  the GDN ReplaySSM fold, the QSA pending ring and the KV move assume a chain;
  startup self-check and the SGLANG_NGRAM_CHECK / _FORCE_REJECT debug hooks.
- spec_utils.py: commit the PLE n-gram history and short-conv state after
  verify in the ReplaySSM branches (physical slot translation). Genuine bug
  fix that also affects MTP topk=1 under --enable-linear-replayssm-spec.
- qwen4_exp.py: drop the "Qwen4 PLE does not support NGRAM" guard and add the
  target-verify allocation self-check.

Inert unless --speculative-algorithm NGRAM is passed; acceptance length
1.11-1.27 lands decode at 22-25 tok/s vs ~56 without, so it stays outside the
default acceptance profile.
